    "description": "\"Five Night At Grek's Hotel\" game : in this amazing puzzle game You have sold your house and moved to a new city to live in. You have a exciting job but don't have enough money to buy your new sweet home yet. So you decided to go to Grek's hotel for five nights, so maybe you could afford the money you needed. The hotel manager is Grek ... but something is wrong with him ...enjoy this Grek's hotel game !",
